    variant="gallery-layout-responsive/largeButtonWithCSSImageContainBackground"
  />

  <p>
    These buttons use <code>background-size: cover;</code> for background image
    filling the alloted space. The following buttons have the background image
    positioning using <code>background-position-y: 20%;</code> . Depending on
    your specific image, you may also need to adjust the background positioning
    along the x and y axis to ensure the main focal point remains visible and
    centered in your implementation.
  </p>

  <component-demo
    component="toggle-button"
